Description: DTK-based LAN file sharing app for deepin
 DShare is a file sharing application built with DTK (Deepin Tool Kit) for the
 deepin desktop. It shares a local directory (~/myshare) over the LAN through a
 built-in HTTP/HTTPS web server and provides a native DTK6 GUI for local file
 management.
 .
 Features:
  * Browse, copy/paste, drag-and-drop, delete inside ~/myshare
  * Browser-side browse, download and upload (plain HTTP, or HTTPS when the
    optional authorization mode is on)
  * LAN peer discovery via UDP multicast (port 5001, group 239.255.42.99)
  * Optional per-device access authorization with desktop confirmation dialog
  * Mobile scan-to-open the currently browsed folder via QR code